## Bucket Sort

Bucket sort is a sorting algorithm that divides elements into several buckets. Each bucket stores elements within a specific range. After distributing elements into buckets, each bucket is sorted individually. Finally all buckets are merged to produce the sorted output.

Bucket sort works best when the input numbers are uniformly distributed.

